      "id": "e03",
      "type": "reading",
      "title": "Next week",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "সামনের সপ্তাহে তুমি কী করবে?",
          "tr": "shamner shoptahe tumi ki korbe?",
          "en": "What will you do next week?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "আমি বন্ধুর বাসায় যাব। ওখানে দুই দিন থাকব।",
          "tr": "ami bondhur bashay jabo. okhane dui din thakbo.",
          "en": "I'll go to a friend's. I'll stay there two days."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "আমি তোমার সাথে যেতে চাই।",
          "tr": "ami tomar shathe jete chai.",
          "en": "I want to go with you."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "তুমি কি শুক্রবার আসতে পারবে?",
          "tr": "tumi ki shukrobar ashte parbe?",
          "en": "Will you be able to come on Friday?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "হ্যাঁ, পারব। আমি তোমাকে ফোন করব।",
          "tr": "hya~, parbo. ami tomake fon korbo.",
          "en": "Yes, I can. I'll phone you."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "ঠিক আছে, আমাকে জানাও।",
          "tr": "thik achhe, amake janao.",
          "en": "OK, let me know."
        }
      ],
      "question": "Where will Nadia go next week?",
      "options": [
        "To the office",
        "To a friend's home",
        "To Sylhet"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "why": "**যাব** 'I will go', **থাকব** 'I will stay'."
    },
